WEBVTT

00:18:13.038 --> 00:18:16.621
Welcome back to Taking for Granted and
my conversation with Danny Kahneman.

00:18:17.329 --> 00:18:19.038
He was just setting the record
straight that as

00:18:19.038 --> 00:18:20.746
an eminent scholar of decision making,

00:18:20.996 --> 00:18:23.538
he does not make decisions
based on a coin toss.

00:18:24.246 --> 00:18:26.079
So how does he make decisions?

00:18:27.913 --> 00:18:36.288
Well, when I look back at my life, it's
been a series of things that, you know,